[i]Incoming transmission...[/i]

[b]...Opening Communications...[/b]


Dear Astronauts,

A new update is landing on the red planet, to help improve Kathy's journey and your experience further.

You can find the change log here:

[b]Primary fixes to existing features[/b]
[list][*]Turned off DLSS FG during ASE control transitions to combat artefacts;
[*]Edited Reflex UI text labels;
[*]Correctly set Reflex UI and functionality on startup;
[*]Automatically turn on Nvidia Reflex when toggling DLSS FG on;
[*]Slightly adjust the FSR to DLSS switch delay to prevent crashes.[/list]
[b]Notable BUG fixes[/b]
[list][*]Fixed a collision issue in Chapter 8;
[*]Fixed a number of display issues related to Frame Generation and Reflex.[/list]

